    "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"ef8c504f7ce4c9327f0e6ea213ce8023\" title=\"子爵夫人的临终梦呓.png\" alt=\"子爵夫人的临终梦呓.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/ef8c504f7ce4c9327f0e6ea213ce8023.png\"/></div><p></p><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        猎物吞下猎手......</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        我的太阳染满鲜红......</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        家在哪里，家在......哪里？</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        在，在这摩挲的石头里、在这起舞的羽毛里、在这躁动的木料里。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        它们要来了，可它们想要祭品！</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        这里已经没有没有能给出去的了。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        只有、只有......我？</span></span></em></span></h5><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"ebf6a6dd072056f208ed1409f647a30e\" title=\"幻觉.png\" alt=\"幻觉.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/ebf6a6dd072056f208ed1409f647a30e.png\"/></div><p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"2285d6611d95e6a4a9bdf68603499da1\" title=\"21.png\" alt=\"21.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/2285d6611d95e6a4a9bdf68603499da1.png\"/></div><p></p><p class=\"media-wrap image-wrap align-center\"></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><h6 style=\"text-align:right;\"><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\">*图片仅供参考</span></h6>",
